WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
We don't do subtle.

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:04.300
We choose bold.

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:07.240
The first time in history flying over the world of America.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.920
We don't limit our ambition.

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:10.400
Never have.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.120
We build big.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.780
We move fast.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:20.940
We bet on ourselves and don't apologize for winning.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:24.520
We say what we mean and we stand by it.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:25.760
You don't know, now you know.

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:32.120
We are fully, proudly, and unapologetically American.
